{"seq":2,"slug":"crash-stability","title":"崩溃与稳定性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crash-reporting-systems","title":"崩溃上报体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/crash-reporting-systems","wordCount":1424,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"symbolication-deobfuscation","title":"符号化与反混淆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/symbolication-deobfuscation","wordCount":1358,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"anr-freeze-detection","title":"ANR 与卡顿检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/anr-freeze-detection","wordCount":1370,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 崩溃与稳定性\n\n应用崩溃是用户流失的头号加速器——一次未处理的崩溃可能永远失去该用户。本章围绕\"发现崩溃→理解崩溃→定位卡顿\"三个递进目标展开：崩溃上报体系解决从信号捕获到 issue 分组的全链路；符号化与反混淆将十六进制地址还原为可读代码位置；ANR 与卡顿检测则覆盖那些\"没有崩溃但用户体验已经崩塌\"的场景。三者共同构成移动稳定性治理的完整闭环。\n"}